{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggteLoL8gccgW5gghkWy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Setup is finished, but the hook status shows PreCompact checkpoints as off, so check that before relying on them.\n\n- **Project:** I created a new local project, `ms`. The usual `~/basic-memory/ms` path was rejected because it sits inside the existing `main` project. It lives at `~/basic-memory-ms` instead, and `primaryProject` is `ms`.\n- **Profile:** Coding, with `repository: \"ms\"`. There was no git remote, so I used the directory name as you said.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task; none existed yet. The Coding Session read-back shows `status` as a nested list, not a string, so the cloud-write corruption didn't happen.\n- **Placement:** I suggested a light starting layout: `sessions/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `notes/` and `schemas/`. No folders were created, and structure can stay emergent.\n- **Settings:** The `basicMemory` block, with `outputStyle: \"basic-memory\"` and `captureEvents: true`, is in `.claude/settings.local.json`. I chose personal over team-wide since you didn't specify.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills at user level with `npx skills add … -g`.\n- **Smoke test:**\n  - The open-decision query returned 0 results without error.\n  - The schema query returned all three schemas.\n  - Hook status found the settings and reports project `ms`, profile `coding` and capture on.\n  - The inbox has 1 pending envelope, 0 archived, and has never been flushed.\n- **PreCompact:** I set `preCompactCapture: \"extractive\"`, but hook status prints \"checkpoint on compact: off\". I didn't investigate. The session brief and `/basic-memory:bm-checkpoint` should still work.\n\nThe proactive-capture reflexes from the output style only start in a new session, so restart to turn them on. Recall is already live in this one.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1377,"cache_read_input_tokens":38714,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1377},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"70820d22-2e57-4bbb-bd59-bfa55fb4a23c","uuid":"d4944618-e499-47b2-b541-8a5ea0f88e61","timestamp":"2026-11-03T23:50:23.641Z","request_id":"req_011CggteLagSVr8uaPkrysf3"}
